<title>HONG KONG: M.Lynch sets warrants on China Light.</title>
<headline>M.Lynch sets warrants on China Light.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 100 million American style call warrants on shares of China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$40.66     PREMIUM	 11.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.7157    GEARING	 6x</p>
<p> LAUNCH DATE	 03.JUN.97    LISTING DATE  26.JUN.97</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  18.MAY.98    PAYDATE	 25.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  5,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$42.80</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
</text>
